`jKprog_spec`: on the managed state with the table `jTab` on `dTJ` and the row `gflat x ++ l` on
stack `0` (every other managed stack empty) it leaves `gflat (liftG (jKerG P K G m fs bs cc) x) ++ l`
on stack `0` and everything else as it was, at cost `jC`.
